# On-screen controls on the platform's own layout (COURTYARD_START=road): the joystick walks down at full push, then
# at a light push, then A swings. Touches go through the same hit testing as fingers (InputScript "touch"); used by
# the phone checks.
100 capture touch_start.png
110 touch 1 stick 0 1
150 lift 1
170 touch 1 stick 0 -0.45
210 lift 1
220 tap 2 confirm
240 capture touch_end.png
260 quit
